<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύκν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>condensation</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάνωσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				260b8
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραίωσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				14
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.695b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑδατώδης</span>, of the air,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				372b31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ νέφος π. ἀέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Top.</u>
					146b29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ διὰ ψῦχος π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.238
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκνόομαι</span>) <i>condensed
			matter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				344a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.721a
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>frequency</i> of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Marcellin.
				<u>Puls.</u>
				228
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in Tactics,
				<i>close order</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰς ἐναγωνίους π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.29.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σαρισῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					18.30.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				10.2
			</span></i> (pl.); esp. of the phalanx, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>aggregation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐκλελεγμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					10.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
